WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.727
Day 8. Blends everywhere.

2
00:00:02.177 --> 00:00:08.989
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:09.489 --> 00:00:16.413
Some words end with two letters the same. Those two letters make one sound. Your child knows them from short words.

4
00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:21.635
The word is brick.

5
00:00:26.854 --> 00:00:27.945
The word is glass.

6
00:00:28.845 --> 00:00:33.402
The words to say to your child are in the yellow box at the top. Read them out.

7
00:00:33.852 --> 00:00:38.375
Read the first row of job one together. Your child reads the second row.

8
00:00:38.825 --> 00:00:42.858
If a word goes wrong, do not say it. Say the same words every time.

9
00:00:43.308 --> 00:00:46.195
Two letters, two sounds. Say each one. Then wait.

10
00:00:46.995 --> 00:00:52.701
Job two is for your child alone. Read each word first. Then draw a line to its picture.

11
00:00:53.151 --> 00:00:57.492
The picture comes after the word. So the picture is the check, and not the clue.

12
00:00:57.942 --> 00:01:01.404
At the end, your child reads three words to you. Mark each one.
